{"title":"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_16\">Problem 16</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 16\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Adams plans a profit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b56bd637cb2c936d539be1b5000a64a898af389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> on the selling price of an article and his expenses are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/a/87a8787ca8fcdf64f42e938d20fa64f63871646d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of sales. The rate of markup on an article that sells for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/3/ce3da6473208f0e7595cbdac956b7abd66b8aad4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$5.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/2/362c0eacae488fdc98f2cde42d08eecd23773ae9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 20\\% \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 25\\% \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 30\\% \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 33\\frac {1}{3}\\% \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 35\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"482\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the cost of the product be C, and the selling price be S. Since Adams wants a 10% profit on the sale, and his expenses are 15% of the sale, we add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/d/ffd9ee0f9412da170a47b7cf595765f91273529f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.10S$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/b/70b071e5acfbb161a77e7ec614913945aaeaeb5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.15S$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" /> to the cost to get the selling price.\nThen, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/9/1c90b84191476485056d760be66439774dcc38ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=C+0.15S+0.10S \\Rightarrow 0.75S=C \\Rightarrow S=\\frac{4}{3}C \\Rightarrow \\fbox{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"440\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME\" title=\"1953 AHSME\">1953 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1953 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1953\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&